{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42743","headline":"秋夕书怀 一 · 刘兼","name":"秋夕书怀 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒僻淹留岁已深，解龟无计恨难任。\n守方半会蛮夷语，贺厦全忘燕雀心。\n夜静倚楼悲月笛，秋寒欹枕泣霜砧。\n宦情总逐愁肠断，一筯鲈鱼直万金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}